      <title>吉利8月销量增长8%而埃安增长34.53%，极氪翻倍领克暴跌37%</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260901/%E5%90%89%E5%88%A98%E6%9C%88%E9%94%80%E9%87%8F%E5%A2%9E%E9%95%BF8%E8%80%8C%E5%9F%83%E5%AE%89%E5%A2%9E%E9%95%BF34.53%E6%9E%81%E6%B0%AA%E7%BF%BB%E5%80%8D%E9%A2%86%E5%85%8B%E6%9A%B4%E8%B7%8C37/</link>
